								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1379.msg13754#msg13754">Re: New Tower of Frozen Shadow beaten</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> January 18, 2005, 07:24:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Wow, I saw the link yesterdat but didn&#039;t know it was Khaarma who won it.&nbsp; Gratz to a cool cleric!&nbsp; Would love to have been there, bet it was a fun event.
						</td>
					</tr>
