							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hehe Tiiden,<br /><br />Congrats to Khaarma..and congrats to you all..you reached 8th floor (or is it 7th?)<br /><br />Visited the area with Zarie on Saturday 15th Jan and was told a raid going on in TTOFS.<br /><br />New npc showed indifferent to me but attacked immediately so I thought I would give it a try on the snowbone skelllie....mistake...nope didnt die....after all --- I am lazy monkette:) FD!!!<br /><br />Be safe and congrats and realised it was like old times and a one time GM event:)<br /><br /><br /><br />
