							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							gratz guys.<br /><br />WOW tiiden, could you be any more of a prick to other people just b/c they aren&#039;t as well geared as you or as flagged as far as you.&nbsp; and based on your post i&#039;m surprised conviction&#039;s head made it through the zone to qvic.&nbsp; ...well forsaken is gone i guess we need a new one.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /> <br /><br />Baron Blogch Gimptastic<br />Proud Member of Dawning Nemesis<br />Rodcet Nife
