								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Like I said, those of us in Conviction would get a kick out of that post.&nbsp; Thus who aren&#039;t - don&#039;t understand my comment at all.&nbsp; You don&#039;t have a clue what I&#039;m referring to, and have taken it completely out of context.&nbsp; 
