								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							BTW DA/EIE/APPS had cleared the zone all the way up to the sixth floor but at 2am+ and 6 + hours folks were getting tired and most logged.<br /><br />The first fight on the first floor boss mob was by far the hardest of all the floors we did.&nbsp; <br /><br />On Sunday we raided other targets could not get back to finish&nbsp; <br />
