							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1379.msg14277#msg14277">Quote from: Givins on February 05, 2005, 04:10:04 pm</a></div><div class="quote">If you think I am so naive to think that shield is the phatest loot of all time or anything close to it, you missed what I was trying to say.  All I wanted to do is let peeps know about a cool event that happened.  You show very little class by posting a series of &quot;LoL&quot; posts because you think the loot is crap.  And if you somehow think that you convince me or anyone else that you are uber by laughing at other people&#039;s loot or titles, trust me, it doesn&#039;t.  <br /></div><br />It had nothing to do with the loot being crap, it is actually quite nice.&nbsp; It was in reference to the person that got to loot the item, thus the comment made by Tiiden.
